    "text": "I, R. Saseelan, Returning Officer of the Chavakachcheri Pradeshiya Sabha, do hereby declare under Section 10A(1)(a) of the (Chapter 262) Local Authorities Elections Ordinance that Mr. Selvarathinam Ananthakumar of the Chavakachcheri Pradeshiya Sabha has vacated his office of member of that Pradeshiya Sabha as he has been ceased to be a member of the All Ceylon Tamil Congress.",
